{"id": "fb7bd575-1991-4836-b971-bea471d5f9ee", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "Service Quotas returns small pages and Bedrock has a lot of quotas, so I'll have a background check page through the full list for me.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_Pcdx3hTQiloCWEFoUf6IA3", "tool_name": "subagent", "input": {"agent_type": "generic", "name": "sonnet5-quota-check", "prompt": "{
  "task": "Determine whether a tokens-per-day quota exists for Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5 in Amazon Bedrock in us-east-1, and report the applied (current) value.",
  "context": "User asks 'Is there a tokens-per-day quota for Claude Sonnet 5 in us-east-1? If there is, what is our applied value?' Use AWS account 123456789012, region us-east-1. Service Quotas ServiceCode is 'bedrock'. The list_service_quotas response is paginated with small pages (~19 items/page, NextToken) so you must loop through ALL pages (use use_aws service-quotas list_service_quotas with MaxResults=100 and NextToken, with a jmespath_filter to keep output small, e.g. {Next:NextToken,M:Quotas[?contains(QuotaName,'Sonnet 5') || contains(QuotaName,'Sonnet-5') || contains(QuotaName,'Sonnet 5.')].{Name:QuotaName,Code:QuotaCode,Value:Value,Adjustable:Adjustable}}). Also check list_aws_default_service_quotas for default values if you find a quota (applied value = Value from list_service_quotas / get_service_quota, which reflects applied account-level value; also check list_requested_service_quota_change_history_by_quota for pending increases). Also list every quota whose name contains 'Sonnet 5' (all of them, any unit) and note any 'tokens per day' variants (cross-region / global / in-region). If no Sonnet 5 quota exists, also list the closest names (e.g., other Sonnet versions with 'per day' tokens) and say clearly that no Sonnet 5 entry was found. Verify via verify_aws_claim whether Bedrock documents a tokens-per-day quota for Claude Sonnet 5 if the Service Quotas search turns up nothing.",
  "criteria": "Return quota name(s), quota code(s), applied value, default value, adjustable flag, and whether the quota is cross-region/global vs in-region. Be explicit if nothing was found after exhausting all pages."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Paginate Bedrock quotas to find Claude Sonnet 5 daily token quota"}], "created_at": null}

